   "Perform risk assessment and treatment from an asset inventory, including documented acceptance.",
   "Apply NIST CSF 2.0 and ISO/IEC 27001 concepts and map controls across frameworks and regulations.",
   "Draft policies, standards and procedures, and operate an exception process.",
   "Conduct a business impact analysis and plan continuity and disaster recovery.",
   "Collect evidence, test controls and write audit findings.",
   "Assess, contract with and monitor third parties.",
   "Produce a risk register, policy pack and management review."
