    "id": "mod_c22_3",
    "title": "Module 3: Zero trust principles",
    "description": "\"Zero trust\" is often marketed as a product. It is an architectural approach: no implicit trust is granted to a user, device or workload based on its network location or ownership; every access to a resource is authenticated, authorised and evaluated against dynamic policy, per session, as close to the resource as practical, and continuously monitored.",
